    "body": "## Summary\nImplements ATOM 7 for issue #425. Native browser tooltip delays are removed only from toast/notification-related hover surfaces. Custom hints appear synchronously on pointer entry and keyboard focus, with no timers or CSS transitions. Persistent notification toasts remain independent from the temporary hint.\n\n## Audit map and delay sources\n\n| Surface | Selector / owner | Text source | Before / delay source | After / close |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Topbar influence | `#balance [data-profile-stat=\"influence\"] .statIcon`; `ui-core.js::syncTopbarStatTitles` | Active UI profile stat-title map | Native `title`; browser-managed tooltip delay | Reusable `#statHoverHint` on pointerenter/focusin; pointerleave/focusout hides only the hint |\n| Topbar reputation | `#balance [data-profile-stat=\"rep\"] .statIcon`; same owner | Active UI profile stat-title map | Native `title`; browser-managed tooltip delay | Same immediate custom hint; uses synchronized current-profile text |\n| Topbar balance | `#balance [data-profile-stat=\"points\"] .statIcon`; same owner | Active UI profile stat-title map | Native `title`; browser-managed tooltip delay | Same immediate custom hint |\n| Topbar wins | `#balance [data-profile-stat=\"wins\"] .statIcon`; same owner | Active UI profile stat-title map | Native `title`; browser-managed tooltip delay | Same immediate custom hint |\n| Points-cap messages | `.pointsWrap`, `#mePoints`, `#mePointsOverflow`; `ui-core.js` stat render/cap path | Existing `Game.Data.CAP_MESSAGES.points` | Dynamic native `title`; browser-managed tooltip delay | Cap text via the immediate custom hint; on focus the actual statIcon owns `aria-describedby` |\n| Weekly reputation-cap message | `#meRepNeed`; `ui-core.js` stat render/cap path | Existing `Game.Data.CAP_MESSAGES.rep` | Dynamic native `title`; browser-managed tooltip delay | Existing message via immediate custom hint; on focus the actual statIcon owns `aria-describedby` |\n| Lottery top-menu action | `#btnLotteryTop`; `ui-menu.js::applyMenuLabels` | Existing localized unavailable text | Native `title`; browser-managed tooltip delay; click path separately uses the existing lottery toast | Immediate custom hint on pointer/focus; existing click and `showLotteryToast` behavior preserved |\n\nInternal stat/action/delta/lottery notification toasts are application-owned persistent nodes, not delayed native hover surfaces. Their show and click-dismiss mechanisms were audited and left intact. Unrelated battle-control titles were not changed. No Safari tooltip timing control is attempted.\n\n## Changed files\n\n- `AsyncScene/Web/index.html`, `AsyncScene/Web/ui/ui-core.js`, `AsyncScene/Web/ui/ui-menu.js`, `AsyncScene/Web/style-base.css`\n- Matching docs surfaces: `docs/index.html`, `docs/ui/ui-core.js`, `docs/ui/ui-menu.js`, `docs/style-base.css`\n- `tools/test_stage6_instant_stat_hover_hints.py`\n- `tools/test_stage6_stat_cap_hint_aria_dom.html`\n\nThe docs menu file had unrelated pre-existing drift from Web; it was preserved, and the ATOM 7 hint change itself is synchronized.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 tools/test_stage6_instant_stat_hover_hints.py`: PASS, 11 checks covering immediate/no-timer hints, migrated title removal, keyboard focus, pointerleave behavior, five profile copy maps, independent/click-dismiss persistent toasts, no auto-dismiss, reusable hint node, touch behavior, and mirror parity.\n- `tools/test_stage6_stat_cap_hint_aria_dom.html`: executed in Codex In-app Browser, PASS for points and REP. It loads the actual app in an iframe, activates each cap message, focuses the statIcon, and asserts its `aria-describedby` references the visible hint with correct text, the nonfocusable parent has no association, and blur removes it.\n- Stage 6: `python3 tools/test_stage6_step9_click_persistent_stat_toast.py` and `python3 tools/test_stage6_step9_five_profile_runtime_defects.py`: PASS.\n- Stage 7.15: `python3 tools/test_stage7_15_31_oleg_escape_lifecycle.py` and `python3 tools/test_stage7_15_23_nastya_crowd_vote.py`: PASS.\n- Syntax: `node --check` for Web/docs `ui-core.js`, `node --check AsyncScene/Web/ui/ui-menu.js`, `python3 -m py_compile tools/test_stage6_instant_stat_hover_hints.py`, and `git diff --check`: PASS.\n- Web/docs `ui-core.js` copies are byte-identical. Existing profile labels were checked in Codex In-app Browser for all five profiles. The Alpha live UI exposed its localized `репа` label and led to the earlier stale-text correction. Persistent startup stat toasts remained separate clickable nodes.\n- Browser: embedded Codex In-app Browser against the local checkout and the committed DOM regression page. No external browser or Safari acceptance was used.\n\n## Invariants\n\nNo resource-award mechanics, economy, stat delta timing, `COALESCE_MS = 90`, NPC/training scenario, or persistent notification copy changed. Persistent toasts still require a click, remain independent, can coexist, and are unaffected by pointerleave. Existing lottery and action toast behavior remains intact.\n\n## Latest revision\n\n- Parent: `e6d5c2296a118e4134f521a8457109a9700d3c5b`\n- Exact PR HEAD for re-review: `467ebac408545dcf443d79fa4807ce9783f6d94c`\n- GitHub CI on this HEAD: `telemetry-receiver-checks` run 38517343519 PASS; `ai-forensics-evidence` run 38517343461 PASS.\n- Safari PASS: not claimed. PR remains Draft and unmerged.\n\nCloses #425",
